#: babybuddy/site_settings.py:25
msgid "Default minimum nap start time"
msgstr "Hora mínima d'inici de les becaines per defecte"

#: babybuddy/site_settings.py:27
msgid ""
"The minimum default time that a sleep entry is consider a nap. If set the "
"nap property will be preselected if the start time is within the bounds."
msgstr ""
"Hora mínima a partir de la qual un registre de son es considera una becaina "
"per defecte. Si s'estableix, l'opció de becaina es marca sola quan l'hora "
"d'inici queda dins dels límits."

#: babybuddy/site_settings.py:33
msgid "Default maximum nap start time"
msgstr "Hora màxima d'inici de les becaines per defecte"

#: babybuddy/site_settings.py:35
msgid ""
"The maximum default time that a sleep entry is consider a nap. If set the "
"nap property will be preselected if the start time is within the bounds."
msgstr ""
"Hora màxima fins a la qual un registre de son es considera una becaina per "
"defecte. Si s'estableix, l'opció de becaina es marca sola quan l'hora "
"d'inici queda dins dels límits."

#: babybuddy/site_settings.py:49
msgid "Time diff between feedings based on end"
msgstr "Temps entre preses comptat des del final"

#: babybuddy/site_settings.py:51
msgid ""
"Use feeding end instead of start time for displaying time between feedings"
msgstr ""
"Calcula el temps entre preses a partir de l'hora de final en lloc de la "
"d'inici"

